				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				8.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὔργον ἔστ᾽ ἐ.</span> it <i>must be
